			"notes": "This is the first release of this mod.\n\nMinecraft version: 1.17.1\n\n### Additions: \n- Charcoal Block: a block that is made of charcoal. It has the same properties than the coal block?\n- Flight Item: An item that allows all players to enable and disable creative-like flight. Cannot disable in creative and spectator mode.\n- God item: An item that allows any player to have the same protection than creative players.\n- Command Block Opener: An item that allows players to open command blocks in any gamemode. Currently, non-creative players can't change contents.\n\nFind more versions on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/random_tweaks)."
